 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Argument and concession",
     "texto": [
      "**Selvom** introduces a difficulty that doesn't cancel the main idea: **Selvom solenergi kræver plads, kan den mindske udledningen.** = Although solar energy requires space, it can reduce emissions.",
      "**På trods af** is followed by a noun: **På trods af prisen** = despite the price."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Talking about impact",
     "texto": [
      "**føre til** = to lead to; **medføre** = to cause; **påvirke** = to affect. In a text, check who receives the effect and whether it is presented as a fact or a possibility."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
